%% Resource resolution during main paint sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant App as Application
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant Frame as FrameEngine facade
  participant Capture as FrameCaptureService
  participant Ordinary as OrdinaryPaintPlanner
  participant Supplement as SelectedMoveSupplementPlanner
  participant Assets as PaintAssetBindingService
  participant Facts as contracts/internal FrameFactsPort
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Session as SurfaceResourceSession
  participant Cache as ImageResolveCache
  participant Resolver as contracts/public CanvasResourceResolver
  participant Painter as Main painter
  participant Port as contracts/public CanvasResourcePort
  participant Guards as contracts/internal guard seams
  participant State as Public runtime state
  participant Signals as Repaint signals

  Surface->>Runtime: successful attach accepted
  Runtime-->>Surface: active surface token
  Surface->>Session: creates SurfaceResourceSession(resolver, resolverGeneration)

  Surface->>Frame: paint main scene request(viewportRect, devicePixelRatio, SurfaceResourceSession)
  Frame->>Capture: capture main frame once
  Capture->>Facts: capture committed main-frame facts once
  Facts->>Store: read committed frame revision facts
  Store-->>Facts: documentRevision, structuralRevision, boundsRevision, elementVisualRevision, backgroundRevision, gridRevision
  Facts-->>Capture: immutable frame revision facts
  Capture->>Resources: capture resourceVisualRevision once
  Resources-->>Capture: resourceVisualRevision
  Capture-->>Frame: CapturedMainFrame
  Frame->>Ordinary: build/reuse ordinary committed records
  Ordinary->>Facts: resolve ordinary row facts by captured revisions
  Facts->>Store: read committed row snapshots
  Store-->>Facts: immutable ordinary row facts or stale rejection
  Facts-->>Ordinary: ordinary row facts
  Ordinary-->>Frame: ordinary committed records
  opt selectedMoveDelta is active
    Frame->>Supplement: stage selected move supplement after ordinary records
    Supplement->>Facts: resolve selected row facts by captured revisions
    Facts->>Store: read selected row snapshots
    Store-->>Facts: immutable selected row facts or stale rejection
    Facts-->>Supplement: selected row facts
    Supplement-->>Frame: merged ordinary and supplement records
  end
  Note over Ordinary,Supplement: Row facts are resolved through FrameFactsPort for bounded candidate handles with structuralRevision/generation/orderToken stale rejection.
  Note over Frame: Each image render record carries resourceId from a committed row fact.

  opt records contain image resource ids
    loop for each image RenderElementRecord
      Frame->>Assets: bind descriptor to paint asset
      Assets->>Facts: read descriptor facts and resourceRevision by resourceId
      Facts->>Store: read descriptor facts from committed state
      Store-->>Facts: CanvasImageResource with CanvasAppKeyResourceSource.key or missing descriptor
      Facts-->>Assets: immutable descriptor facts or missing descriptor
      Assets->>Session: resolve paint image(descriptor snapshot, resourceRevision)

      alt descriptor is missing
        Session-->>Assets: bounded missing image placeholder
      else descriptor exists
        Session->>Cache: lookup key(resolverGeneration, resourceId, resourceRevision)

        alt cache hit
          Cache-->>Session: cached app-owned ui.Image
          Session-->>Assets: app-owned ui.Image
        else same-frame null result already seen
          Session-->>Assets: bounded placeholder without retry
        else per-frame resolver budget exceeded
          Session-->>Assets: bounded placeholder, session records at most one pending throttled follow-up repaint, no cache write
        else cache miss and resolver budget available
          Session->>Resolver: resolveImage(CanvasImageResource with CanvasAppKeyResourceSource.key)
          Note over Resolver: Resolver reads resource.source as CanvasAppKeyResourceSource.key through public API.
          Note over Session,Resolver: Synchronous app-owned resolver boundary only. No async resolver, file, network, asset-bundle, or engine IO loading.
          opt resolver attempts public runtime mutation
            Session->>Guards: enter resolver callback and enforce mutation guard
            Resolver->>Runtime: reentrant edit/load/resource dirty/pointer mutation
            Runtime--x Resolver: StateError, mutation rejected without runtime effects
            Note over Runtime,Session: Resolver reentrancy rejection does not mutate document, selection, preview, caches, repaint, or actions.
          end
          Resolver-->>Session: app-owned ui.Image or null

          alt app returns ui.Image
            Session->>Cache: store key(resolverGeneration, resourceId, resourceRevision) -> app-owned ui.Image reference
            Session-->>Assets: app-owned ui.Image paint asset
          else app returns null
            Session->>Session: suppress null result for current frame key(resolverGeneration, resourceId, resourceRevision)
            Session-->>Assets: bounded missing image placeholder
          end
        end
      end
      Assets-->>Frame: resolved paint asset or placeholder
    end
  end

  Frame->>Painter: paint immutable records with resolved image assets or placeholders
  Painter-->>Surface: draw main scene

  Note over Assets,Resolver: PaintAssetBindingService is the only frame collaborator that receives SurfaceResourceSession, painter owns no typed CanvasResourceResolver reference.
  Note over Session,Resolver: Returned ui.Image objects are owned by the application. The engine never disposes app-owned images.
  Note over Capture,Store: Main paint uses FrameFactsPort for committed frame and row facts, does not materialize CanvasDocument, and does not read DocumentProjectionCache.
  Note over Port,Store: ResourcePort cannot mutate descriptors. Descriptor mutation is only through the CanvasEdit commit path outside this sequence.
  Note over Surface,Painter: Resource resolution uses surface session state, frame inputs, and resource descriptors only.

  opt application reports changed external resource visuals
    App->>Port: markResourceDirty(resourceId) or markAllResourcesDirty()
    Port->>Runtime: delegate resource dirty signal
    Runtime->>Resources: increment resourceVisualRevision
    Resources-->>Runtime: ResourceDirtyOutcome with target/all invalidation
    Runtime->>Session: invalidate target resource entries or clear all entries if attached
    Session->>Cache: invalidate entries by resourceId or all
    Runtime->>State: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.resourceVisual
    Runtime->>Signals: schedule main repaint
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene

    Note over Port,Resources: Dirty visual invalidation publishes resourceVisual public state only. It does not mutate descriptors, document revision, action events, preview, or CanvasDocument projection.
    Note over Runtime: Dirty visual invalidation does not mutate the selection owner.
  end

  opt active surface receives a different resourceResolver
    Surface->>Session: replace resolver
    Session->>Session: increment resolverGeneration and clear stale cache entries
  end

  opt surface detaches, disposes, or swaps runtime
    Surface->>Session: drop session
    Session->>Cache: drop entries without disposing app-owned ui.Image
  end
